<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36809" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξάντης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>, of
		patients, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>out of danger,
				healthy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. γίνεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					3.3
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.41
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξάντη ποιεῖν τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					244e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>harmless,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξάντη φάσκοντες ποιήσειν</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῆνιν Ἑκάτης</span>) <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				4.90
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen.,
				<i>free from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					3.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νούσου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					1.14
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				1279
			</span></i> (= <i><span class="en">
				<u>Trag.Adesp.</u>
				151
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δειλίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					6.192b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεστηκώς, μαινόμενος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				346.42
			</span></i>.</div>
